---
// Original diagram for the proposed YouTube-like product design, not YouTube internals.
---

<figure
  class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram"
  aria-labelledby="video-product-lifecycle-caption"
>
  <svg
    class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 678"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="video-product-lifecycle-title video-product-lifecycle-desc"
  >
    <title id="video-product-lifecycle-title">
      傳輸、資產與影片可見性的三個獨立生命週期
    </title>
    <desc id="video-product-lifecycle-desc"
      >UploadSession 管理原檔傳輸，MediaAsset 管理指定版本的產物處理，Video
      管理公開、未公開或私密的可見性。只有目前 generation
      的最低資產通過驗證、產品規則允許且影片未下架，才能在交易中啟用播放資產；私密影片亦適用。</desc
    >
    <defs
      ><marker
        id="video-product-lifecycle-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
        ><path
          class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__head"
          d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z"></path></marker
      ></defs
    >
    <text class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__title" x="24" y="32"
      >不要把三種生命週期塞進一個 status</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__panel"
      x="20"
      y="68"
      width="920"
      height="130"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="40"
      y="99">UploadSession</text
    ><text class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__body" x="40" y="126"
      >傳輸進度</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__card"
      x="290"
      y="88"
      width="176"
      height="48"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="378"
      y="118"
      text-anchor="middle">created</text
    ><path
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 466 112 H 508"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-lifecycle-arrow)"></path><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__card"
      x="508"
      y="88"
      width="176"
      height="48"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="596"
      y="118"
      text-anchor="middle">uploading</text
    ><path
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 684 112 H 726"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-lifecycle-arrow)"></path><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__card"
      x="726"
      y="88"
      width="176"
      height="48"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="814"
      y="118"
      text-anchor="middle">verified</text
    ><text class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__body" x="290" y="171"
      >確認原檔完整；可另走 aborted / expired</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__panel"
      x="20"
      y="218"
      width="920"
      height="130"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="40"
      y="249">MediaAsset</text
    ><text class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__body" x="40" y="276"
      >特定版本的產物</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__card"
      x="290"
      y="238"
      width="176"
      height="48"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="378"
      y="268"
      text-anchor="middle">pending</text
    ><path
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 466 262 H 508"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-lifecycle-arrow)"></path><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__card"
      x="508"
      y="238"
      width="176"
      height="48"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="596"
      y="268"
      text-anchor="middle">processing</text
    ><path
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__arrow"
      d="M 684 262 H 726"
      marker-end="url(#video-product-lifecycle-arrow)"></path><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__card"
      x="726"
      y="238"
      width="176"
      height="48"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="814"
      y="268"
      text-anchor="middle">ready</text
    ><text class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__body" x="290" y="321"
      >資產可失敗與重試；ready 必須代表驗證通過</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__panel"
      x="20"
      y="368"
      width="920"
      height="130"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="40"
      y="399">Video</text
    ><text class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__body" x="40" y="426"
      >產品可見性</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__focus"
      x="290"
      y="388"
      width="176"
      height="48"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="378"
      y="418"
      text-anchor="middle">private</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__focus"
      x="508"
      y="388"
      width="176"
      height="48"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="596"
      y="418"
      text-anchor="middle">unlisted</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__focus"
      x="726"
      y="388"
      width="176"
      height="48"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label"
      x="814"
      y="418"
      text-anchor="middle">public</text
    ><text class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__body" x="290" y="471"
      >可見性不是進度；每次變更推進 metadata_revision</text
    ><rect
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__warn"
      x="20"
      y="530"
      width="920"
      height="124"
      rx="14"></rect><text
      class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__warning"
      x="44"
      y="564">啟用播放資產是一個條件交易，與公開可見性分開。</text
    ><text class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label" x="44" y="594"
      >目前 generation ＋ 最低可播資產 ready ＋ 產品審核允許 ＋ 尚未 blocked</text
    ><text class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__body" x="44" y="626"
      >visibility 決定誰能看；播放資產指標
      決定看哪個版本；下架旗標獨立覆蓋兩者。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <div class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__mobile">
    <ol class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__steps">
      <li>
        <span class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__step-label"
          >UploadSession · 傳輸</span
        ><strong>created → uploading → verified</strong><p>
          只有確認物件與完整性後，才能標為
          verified。中止與過期走各自的終止路徑。
        </p>
      </li><li>
        <span class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__step-label"
          >MediaAsset · 產物</span
        ><strong>pending → processing → ready</strong><p>
          每個 generation、格式與解析度各有資產。失敗能重試；ready 代表已驗證。
        </p>
      </li><li>
        <span class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__step-label"
          >Video · 可見性</span
        ><strong>private / unlisted / public</strong><p>
          三者是可選規則。每次變更推進
          metadata_revision；下架旗標覆蓋可見性與資產啟用狀態。
        </p>
      </li><li>
        <span class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__step-label"
          >播放資產閘門 · 一個交易</span
        ><strong>私密影片也能啟用可播產物</strong><p>
          檢查目前 generation、最低資產 ready、審核允許與尚未 blocked，再更新
          播放資產指標。
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol><p class="video-product-lifecycle-diagram__mobile-note">
      資產 ready 不會自動變 public；visibility 也不能證明資產可播放。
    </p>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="video-product-lifecycle-caption">
    圖 3｜分開追蹤傳輸、處理與可見性，再由條件交易啟用播放資產。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram {
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
    color: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__desktop {
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-surface);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__panel {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__focus {
    fill: #edf5f0;
    stroke: #35734c;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__warn {
    fill: #fff2e9;
    stroke: #ad4d17;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__body {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__title {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__label {
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__small {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__accent {
    fill: #256442;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__warning {
    fill: #9a4310;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__mono {
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__dashed {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 6 5;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__head {
    fill: var(--dg-rule-strong);
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__rule {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__dot {
    fill: #35734c;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__steps li {
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    background: var(--dg-surface);
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__steps strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__steps p {
    margin: var(--space-xs) 0 0;
    color: var(--dg-ink-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__step-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    color: #256442;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__mobile-note {
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border-left: 3px solid #ad4d17;
    background: var(--dg-surface-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--dg-ink-2);
  }
  .video-product-lifecycle-diagram figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__focus {
    fill: #183b2b;
    stroke: #72ba8c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__warn {
    fill: #3f2b1c;
    stroke: #edaa78;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__accent,
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"])
    .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__step-label {
    fill: #8ed1a8;
    color: #8ed1a8;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__warning {
    fill: #f4ba8d;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__dot {
    fill: #72ba8c;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"])
    .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__mobile-note {
    border-left-color: #edaa78;
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .video-product-lifecycle-diagram__mobile {
      display: block !important;
    }
  }
</style>
